# 3x3 piston door, v3: wiring moved out of the walkway. ONE lever. 16 wide (x), 6 deep (z), 7 tall.
# doorway is x=8..10, walk through north<->south. everything is above head height (beam at y=4-5)
# or off to the sides. lever is on the back of the east wall, next to the door. ON = closed.
# timing: P1 (west) fires right away, releases last (3 slow repeaters hold it).
#         P2 (top relay) fires after 2 slow repeaters (16 ticks), releases first.
palette:
O obsidian
S smooth_stone
Y slime_block
H honey_block
E sticky_piston[facing=east]
W sticky_piston[facing=west]
D redstone_wire
n repeater[facing=south,delay=1]
r repeater[facing=south,delay=4]
w repeater[facing=west,delay=4]
q repeater[facing=east,delay=1]
l lever[face=wall,facing=south,powered=false]

